# Internal QA narrative - kept locally, never published. Its figures go stale the
# moment the archive is corrected, and a reviewer who found it would read numbers
# that contradict the site.
*VERIFIED.md
*verified.md

# The audit checklist workbook, same class of internal artifact as the narrative above.
# Deliberately NOT written as *VERIFIED.xlsx: that would also match
# data/FINAL_migration_population_panel_2010-2022_VERIFIED.xlsx, the archive's central
# deliverable, linked from both Data files pages. Nor as AUDIT_*, which would swallow
# verification/AUDIT_response.md - the record of how each audit claim was adjudicated,
# which belongs in the published trail.
AUDIT_checklist_*.xlsx
